    "native_expectation": "SolidCraft saves one Dog holes Sketch and one Clamp slots Sketch with associative pattern/mirror relationships. Baseline geometry contains 8 \u00d88 holes and 8 straight Slots. No expanded set of independent seed commands is emitted.",
    "generated_relationship": "Forge binds the real native curves returned by the seed profile, feeds those ids into sketch.pattern.rectangular, binds the pattern curves, and feeds those into sketch.mirror. User Python never contains SolidCraft-generated ids.",
    "q5_required": true,
    "q5_reason": "Change hole_diameter 8->10 mm, hole_pitch 25->30 mm and slot_pitch 50->30 mm in the saved .sc design. Without rerunning Python all existing pattern and mirror copies must follow the changed seed and spacing. Pattern counts remain native editable parameters, but SolidCraft 0.42 mirrors a fixed selected entity set and does not automatically adopt new entities added later by an upstream count change.",
    "mutation": "Change hole_diameter 8->10 mm, hole_pitch 25->30 mm and slot_pitch 50->30 mm in the saved .sc design. Without rerunning Python all existing pattern and mirror copies must follow the changed seed and spacing. Pattern counts remain native editable parameters, but SolidCraft 0.42 mirrors a fixed selected entity set and does not automatically adopt new entities added later by an upstream count change."
